{"title":"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Proving_that_is_division)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Proving that  is division)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Fast)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Fast)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2(Meta-Solving_Technique)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2(Meta-Solving Technique)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A binary operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6dda9b4c504bad80fd4308d62fb52fb41f3aefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" /> has the properties that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/3/bd3adfdcaa75548e6f40aff3ca7c4d1fae9b1630.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\,\\diamondsuit\\, (b\\,\\diamondsuit \\,c) = (a\\,\\diamondsuit \\,b)\\cdot c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"177\" height=\"18\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/1/c51c90ff56fea4118831ddcedc6f2e873eee685a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\,\\diamondsuit \\,a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"16\" /> for all nonzero real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f73d811eca6419d9c9a27423331d71ff06eb957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. (Here <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/1/8f1fb66751f2ee2626c75303485dba473c39a2f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cdot$\" style=\"vertical-align: 3px\" width=\"3\" height=\"2\" /> represents multiplication). The solution to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e7a599f0672c592fe05f3afa03d4d262284c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\,\\diamondsuit\\, (6\\,\\diamondsuit\\, x)=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" /> can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f650522cfc3d38eaa6a9a999cc47058c18d72a97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{p}{q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"9\" height=\"21\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/d/22dd6d9587b2fe28d6b8fd7d058a3e8326763199.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca110044962f0562ab461e843e271b6b72da743a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }109\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }201\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }301\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }3049\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }33,601$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"478\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b46d958f7efc6c4908916137fc1897629e54d5ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\, \\diamondsuit \\, a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />, and think of division. Testing, we see that the first condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/e/19e753f55b2520fbb7ebbf90b65e6a19f4bd8d8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\, \\diamondsuit \\, (b \\, \\diamondsuit \\, c) = (a \\, \\diamondsuit \\, b) \\cdot c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\" /> is satisfied, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e679696139c70011a192d8025b5b89e3e5f72a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{\\frac{b}{c}} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"73\" height=\"40\" />. Therefore, division can be the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6dda9b4c504bad80fd4308d62fb52fb41f3aefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" />. Solving the equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aa600eb150f204bc3ea21cdc18069a047c1d461.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2016}{\\frac{6}{x}} = \\frac{2016}{6} \\cdot x = 336x = 100\\implies x=\\frac{100}{336} = \\frac{25}{84},\\]\" width=\"405\" height=\"44\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/c/80cdece00050abf94704ae262763b6af3c63b63a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 + 84 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }109}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"157\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Proving_that_is_division.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Proving_that_is_division)\">Solution 2 (Proving that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6dda9b4c504bad80fd4308d62fb52fb41f3aefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" /> is division)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Proving that  is division)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the given conditions hold for all nonzero numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f73d811eca6419d9c9a27423331d71ff06eb957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/5/18532aee00d4c3e19660169cf70afc93bb7bb875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" /> From the first two givens, this implies that \n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/b/3dbd37b2c00f4703b5b4d738989f9c451defce94.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a\\diamondsuit\\, (a\\diamondsuit\\, {a})=(a\\diamondsuit\\, a)\\cdot{a}.\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nFrom <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/8/9c8f36f2da588afc195c26a4d364a103ce84e26e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\diamondsuit\\,{a}=1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> this equation simply becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/a/cdafcd4fdb23f05d63627c3e500b746171a6721b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\diamondsuit\\,{1}=a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/1/e214bf3a6eccec0d167be12825e1adb21dee78f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=b.$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> Substituting this into the first two conditions, we see that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/f/1dfb096283909a7d7d715f30c1eeb088c4a6eee8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a\\diamondsuit\\, (b\\diamondsuit\\, {c})=(a\\diamondsuit\\, {b})\\cdot{c} \\implies a\\diamondsuit\\, (b\\diamondsuit\\, {b})=(a\\diamondsuit\\, {b})\\cdot{b}.\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a47381e09a4c6f3efad0788637ad3900c95d798f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\diamondsuit\\, {b} =1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"68\" height=\"17\" />, the second equation becomes\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/6/1b6ebb333de1ef4be401b9abef42258194adf4b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a\\diamondsuit\\, {1}=(a\\diamondsuit\\, {b})\\cdot{b} \\implies a=(a\\diamondsuit\\,{b})\\cdot{b}.\\]\" width=\"286\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are nonzero, we can divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> which yields,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/b/3cbb15a09dc577dfc646825acacb521f67e15acb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{b}=(a\\diamondsuit\\, {b}).\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>Now we can find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> straightforwardly:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/99793238cc6a802d028240a38dbd239ba60dea81.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2016}{(\\frac{6}{x})}=100 \\implies 2016=\\frac{600}{x} \\implies x=\\frac{600}{2016} = \\frac{25}{84}.\\]\" width=\"405\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03ddc16cdef1e8eb1d265dbf1d153cb4c0a06d01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=25+84=\\boxed{\\textbf{A)} 109}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"209\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-Benedict T (countmath1)\n</p><p>Note: We only really cared about what <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/206d9fb51d6f8075a0290fec0642d753e17009d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\diamondsuit\\,{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"17\" /> was, so we used the existence of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> to get an expression in terms of just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One way to eliminate the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6dda9b4c504bad80fd4308d62fb52fb41f3aefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" /> in this equation is to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/397fd7b1f33bdbf6ee27a83d1bcee42d222cb331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> so that  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69deeebe6ac569d55d06c787eb1697ad3cadbe03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\,\\diamondsuit\\, (b\\,\\diamondsuit \\,c) = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />. In this case, we can make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc060edc8a27ccb9fb43207afd0979a474b3986.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/9/b29c5421b4a87df49e5bea4e4a9982e7238a1675.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016 \\,\\diamondsuit\\, (6\\,\\diamondsuit\\, x)=100\\implies  (2016\\, \\diamondsuit\\, 6) \\cdot x = 100\\]\" width=\"365\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>By multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/2/8a252f779d2e8a21127aa1bed676d37587bb3d81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"37\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/225f98c783357f4b28ecc0edddb0149b636ee654.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2016\\, \\diamondsuit\\, 6) \\cdot 6 = \\frac{600}{x}\\implies  2016 \\, \\diamondsuit\\, (6\\, \\diamondsuit\\, 6) = \\frac{600}{x}\\]\" width=\"368\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/3/db3c729a8b4996b58f94726c825059748648a3bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\, \\diamondsuit\\, 6 = 2016\\, \\diamondsuit\\, 2016 = 1:$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"197\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e8f7293f3b59d7430e37c1f9c89fdb172bb231e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016 \\, \\diamondsuit\\, (2016\\, \\diamondsuit\\, 2016) = \\frac{600}{x}\\implies  (2016\\, \\diamondsuit\\, 2016) \\cdot 2016 = \\frac{600}{x}\\implies  2016 = \\frac{600}{x}\\]\" width=\"611\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/1/b0168af1bfb251e99dc0e34cb1ac90aa18bcc472.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{600}{2016} = \\frac{25}{84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"38\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c68e2fd396d2a328640f5f9761f4c54b39b19ea0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 + 84 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }109.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can manipulate the given identities to arrive at a conclusion about the binary operator <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6dda9b4c504bad80fd4308d62fb52fb41f3aefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" />.  Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e3494065b237daa79bb6ecedafbf0bb28d5812bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> into the first identity yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa631f9ef3eefa20af72782898744a04fd7f633.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[( a\\ \\diamondsuit\\ b) \\cdot b = a\\ \\diamondsuit\\ (b\\ \\diamondsuit\\  b) = a\\ \\diamondsuit\\  1 = a\\ \\diamondsuit\\ ( a\\ \\diamondsuit\\ a) = ( a\\ \\diamondsuit\\ a) \\cdot a = a.\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"18\" />  Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/4/1b41fb17bdc6f2fe8427ee3d498ecee1fdfd07b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$( a\\ \\diamondsuit\\ b) \\cdot b = a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" /> or, dividing both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b1d6265e67657b5886ce257671d45ff9c0282eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"12\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca99601b60fac675420f10892eaa8f4a823f1d10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$( a\\ \\diamondsuit\\ b) = \\frac{a}{b}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"98\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>Hence, the given equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cf5db8b9732a7285e2e32b264233b3c4dac59f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2016}{\\frac{6}{x}} = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"91\" height=\"44\" />.  Solving yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/0/6a02a5af1e492afe94acf029e74761c6cb2c01aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{100}{336} = \\frac{25}{84},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"38\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c68e2fd396d2a328640f5f9761f4c54b39b19ea0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 + 84 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }109.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e15c8ec2e5d9da8534216284e511a5926d3ea41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit (6 \\diamondsuit x) = (2016 \\diamondsuit 6) \\cdot x = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"273\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def7a8a19252560d6db0a07dbd37a95eb001ffdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit (2016 \\diamondsuit 1) = (2016 \\diamondsuit 2016) \\cdot 1 = 1 \\cdot 1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"362\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/117748bff9710cbc15697627747def517e7dad2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit 2016 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/d/a5d1c9f39cda274ef2fd04ccf990550117fccc3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit (2016 \\diamondsuit 1) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9b8636b145d4a2e613fc685b9c9d43201c6f3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit 1 = 2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c9180cd5d4e45643ac9e52f47aa1470ac79aa22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016  \\diamondsuit 1 = (2016  \\diamondsuit 6) \\cdot 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a78ed20d25c29f5f8f17a656995938e95f59ab06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit 6 = \\frac{2016  \\diamondsuit 1}{6} = 336$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"201\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/a/99a0dfd65ee3ac8aa60f7efb245fdf2ef69ee0b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{100}{2016 \\diamondsuit 6} = \\frac{100}{336} = \\frac{25}{84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"202\" height=\"41\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff5e021bdfe5fa35f00b7aa6d13631d3c2433de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24 + 85 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }109}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"159\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Fast.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Fast)\">Solution 6 (Fast)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Fast)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, looking at the conditions, we know that any nonzero real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/a/78a11f5ff6571c52338e5efa55cd094994e2ec6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\diamondsuit (a \\diamondsuit a) = (a \\diamondsuit a) \\cdot a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"168\" height=\"20\" />\nUsing the next condition, we get that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/364753224219d184fcd173440bd99b93edb3243f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\diamondsuit 1 = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/789e89c0134c9f8de4d49468f156edf311e87e75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit 1 = 2016 \\diamondsuit (6 \\diamondsuit 6) = (2016 \\diamondsuit 6) \\cdot 6 =  2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"363\" height=\"20\" />. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cadcb3c09dc7de0ebd131d0843cb2b63eb9d6d0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit 6 = 336$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"113\" height=\"17\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc6dedb23d0ee8dd53eec1d65d64da1e2a904305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016 \\diamondsuit (6 \\diamondsuit x)=100 \\implies (2016 \\diamondsuit 6) \\cdot x = 100 \\implies 336x=100 \\implies x=\\frac{25}{84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"595\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc1fc14a4afb4f6d777ed2ee0d1ebf4bbf3a87b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }109}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Mathmagicops\n</p><p>~minor edits by CXP\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7\">Solution 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/f/44f499f73c2cbc1c73ff86adde22f4f90629836f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016\\diamondsuit (6\\diamondsuit x)=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"20\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/4/984e33c2554dff4afb0fe383c446344f5b949c4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016\\diamondsuit 6=\\dfrac{100}x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"122\" height=\"38\" /> We do a series of algebraic  manipulations: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af6229161adfa714fff083bb7adb6f4eccfb048a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2016\\diamondsuit 6)\\cdot6=\\dfrac{600}x\\]\" width=\"148\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/02226977d6dcd4932ee3e85ad72a723de25733f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016\\diamondsuit (6\\diamondsuit 6)=\\dfrac{600}x\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/1/80165bc6ed719e9df0d129cb20e06a36038a1d3a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016\\diamondsuit 1=\\dfrac{600}x.\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/6/11626334343be1e4e2ee26c97c3e986a4697bda2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2016\\diamondsuit 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/2/062bedd233717dbada7424909af4515e0da90320.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016a=(2016\\diamondsuit 1)\\cdot 2016\\]\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2ae0106cb8141a84dfea10edde5b916689d8958e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016a=2016\\diamondsuit (1\\diamondsuit 2016)\\]\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/1/5015d00927b4c460f7f7595f29b0114fc7eb28fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1\\diamondsuit 2016.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e12a280aa4f7bb99967add7d19c268a5aad770a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016b=(1\\diamondsuit 2016)\\cdot2016\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f96f18feb4b193df8f916479f1ea907e38f44a84.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016b=1\\diamondsuit (2016\\diamondsuit 2016)\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3b7d30608d8e08f5885f61633dd10f3ccbe1670.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016b=1\\diamondsuit 1=1\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/7/a07250362a8b88f736f8465254c4645fcc25f3ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=\\dfrac1{2016}\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>We notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/6/9565da132c45a06f0e68c73ed5d437203ef310e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\diamondsuit 2016=\\dfrac1{2016},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"131\" height=\"38\" /> which makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/1/6c1f6f11b7c8bf771564f1d6ef8b28f092288f8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\diamondsuit b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" /> look suspiciously like <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/3/603c2510ea8b85d1cfc74156f65c374a547d546a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac ab.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"34\" /> Sure enough, when we try the given condition on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d68e0845a489533a3b7d7caaa8b3e8c0ffcd170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\diamondsuit b=\\dfrac ab,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" /> we see that it works. We evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/0/f103e4333f14d63ab76bfe6988642e506c4a7fe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016\\diamondsuit (6\\diamondsuit x)=100,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"20\" /> and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/5557721f4c3a0f8fe54f3b2a6f10936544a3f756.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\dfrac{25}{84},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" /> and therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/c/28cf42473280f8e27dcf67447551bda0a9a618eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q=25+84=109.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p>~Technodoggo\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8GULAMwu5oE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8GULAMwu5oE</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2.28Meta-Solving_Technique.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2(Meta-Solving_Technique)\">Video Solution 2(Meta-Solving Technique)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2(Meta-Solving Technique)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GmUWIXXf_uk?t=1632\">https://youtu.be/GmUWIXXf_uk?t=1632</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A\">2016 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"201